// (`wasm-bindgen-test-runner`). Each instrumented crate keeps its region in
// the module's linear memory behind `__supercov_region_<crate>`; nothing in
// the process writes it anywhere. This remembers every instance the process
// creates and, as the process ends, writes each region to the test's evidence
// directory under the instrumentation's token, where the run reads it as it
// reads a native process's.
